    <data key="d0">Majid Al Futtaim Centralized Data Lake and Streaming Architecture</data>
    <data key="d1" />
    <data key="d2">The architecture shows an end-to-end data lake platform utilizing EKS for metadata management, MSK (Kafka) and EMR for ingestion/processing into S3, and RDS / Vertica for analytics consumption.</data>
